Only `codex`, `ollama` (mapped to the Codex CLI subprocess factory — not the raw local runtime), and `claude-code` are registered. There is no `anthropic`/`openai`/`xai` arm here, and no `local`/raw-runtime arm either — this whole dispatch table is subprocess-based and orthogonal to `raw_runtime::run_loop`.

