- `crates/familiar-ai-daemon/src/local_worker_runtime.rs:116-286` — local-worker-specific pool helpers (`acquire_with_unknown_capacity_policy`, `define_pools_from_resource_profile`, `acquire_model_load_reservation`), used only by tests today (no caller in non-test code).

